<p style="line-height:1.38; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px"><span style="font-size:11px;"><span style="font-family:Georgia,Times New Roman,Times,serif;"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Hi {{{Recipient.FirstName}}}</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="line-height:1.38; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px"><span style="font-size:11px;"><span style="font-family:Georgia,Times New Roman,Times,serif;"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">I wanted to let you know about an exciting new feature we’ve launched: </span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Enhanced Targeting</span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none"> — designed to help you connect with leads who best match your ideal customer profile.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-size:11px;"><span style="font-family:Georgia,Times New Roman,Times,serif;"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">By opting into Enhanced Targeting in your EverQuote account, </span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:italic"><span style="text-decoration:none">you’ll have access to bid-up on the specific attributes you’re looking for</span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">, including:</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<ul>
	<li aria-level="1" style="list-style-type:disc"><span style="font-size:11px;"><span style="font-family:Georgia,Times New Roman,Times,serif;"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">High intent buyers</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li aria-level="1" style="list-style-type:disc"><span style="font-size:11px;"><span style="font-family:Georgia,Times New Roman,Times,serif;"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Small business owners</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li aria-level="1" style="list-style-type:disc"><span style="font-size:11px;"><span style="font-family:Georgia,Times New Roman,Times,serif;"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Drivers aged 25-65 year old</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li aria-level="1" style="list-style-type:disc"><span style="font-size:11px;"><span style="font-family:Georgia,Times New Roman,Times,serif;"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">And More…</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>
</ul>
&nbsp;

<p style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-size:11px;"><span style="font-family:Georgia,Times New Roman,Times,serif;"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Save your team hours of extra prospecting time, write more new business and find customers with higher lifetime value for your agency by letting us match you with insurance shoppers that align with your target profiles.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
&nbsp;

<p style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-size:11px;"><span style="font-family:Georgia,Times New Roman,Times,serif;"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">This feature is exclusive to our Accelerated Growth Program (AGP) members, who also receive:</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<ul>
	<li aria-level="1" style="list-style-type:disc"><span style="font-size:11px;"><span style="font-family:Georgia,Times New Roman,Times,serif;"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Monthly strategy sessions with a Business Consultant</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li aria-level="1" style="list-style-type:disc"><span style="font-size:11px;"><span style="font-family:Georgia,Times New Roman,Times,serif;"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Loyalty credits for meeting program goals</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li aria-level="1" style="list-style-type:disc"><font face="Georgia, Times New Roman, Times, serif"><span style="font-size: 11px; white-space-collapse: preserve;">Exclusive access to new products for AGP clients only</span></font><br />
	&nbsp;</li>
</ul>

